OL,3,GNEWSAFriends died in 50C desert valley
OL,4,Ahike near Dubai
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo friends died while hiking in up to
OL,7,F50C (122F) heat in a desert valley near
OL,8,FDubai, an inquest heard.
OL,10,FRescue teams discovered the bodies of
OL,11,FAran Martinson, 33, and Cassius Newton,
OL,12,F34, in the holy mountainous region of
OL,13,FWadi Naqab on 18 July.
OL,15,FThe men, from Essex and Dorset
OL,16,Frespectively, both worked in the United
OL,17,FArab Emirates and had set off for their
OL,18,Ftrek at about 07:00 local time (04:00
OL,19,FBST).
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
