OL,3,GNEWSAFriends died in 50C desert valley
OL,4,Ahike near Dubai
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening an inquest in Chelmsford, area
OL,7,Fcoroner Michelle Brown said their
OL,8,Fprovisional causes of death included
OL,9,Fcardiac and respiratory arrest.
